# Go Tooling (DBO)

## Format

```bash
cd backend && go fmt ./...
```

- Tabs for indentation (Go default).
- `gofmt -s` simplifies code; `interface{}` → `any` per `.golangci.yml`.

## Lint

```bash
cd backend && golangci-lint run
```

Enabled linters: `errcheck`, `govet`, `staticcheck`, `unused`, `revive`, `misspell`, `thelper`, `mirror`, `fatcontext`, `loggercheck`, `wsl_v5`, `errorlint`, `nilerr`, `bodyclose`, `contextcheck`, `copyloopvar`.

Key revive rules enforced: `context-as-argument`, `error-naming`, `error-return`, `receiver-naming`.

## Pre-Commit (lefthook)

`go fmt` runs automatically on backend changes via `lefthook.yml`.

## Dev Loop

```bash
cd backend && air    # hot reload via .air.toml
```

## CI

`.github/workflows/tests.yml` runs `go mod tidy` check and `golangci-lint-action` on `./backend`.

## Before Every PR

```bash
cd backend
go fmt ./...
golangci-lint run
go test ./...
```

Clean lint output is required — do not disable linters to pass.
